# Search-only exclusions for ripgrep-based tools (agents' Grep/Glob, editors).
# Files stay tracked and can still be opened explicitly; they are just kept out
# of broad search results because they are generated, vendored or historical.

# Lockfiles and checksums
pnpm-lock.yaml
**/uv.lock
**/go.sum
go.work.sum
**/atlas.sum

# Generated code (edit the owning source and rerun its generator instead)
services/api/docs/
packages/shared/gen/
services/ai/generated/
services/api/internal/infrastructure/ai/rpc/

# Binary/static assets
**/public/brand/

# Agent worktrees and historical memory ledgers
.claude/worktrees/
agentic-memory/CHANGELOG.md
agentic-memory/ARCHIVE_INDEX.md
